msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫嗯……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_1E71D58A_55DC_44D1_93BE_5C4E4AE92DAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2ef8bb7650eefca8777479bb344f32026ca432b2353d1c4f3684c9518d66e26
#. default-sha256: a2e5bff37bfbb221827eee61ca9fafdb83bb0a23909925987204426e6b9562c2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_1E71D58A_55DC_44D1_93BE_5C4E4AE92DAA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Besides, those who yearn for redemption have a tendency to latch on to the spiritual. "
"⟪k:2⟫I thought taking advantage of that would work to our benefit."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……渴求救赎的人，⟪k:2⟫容易轻信怪力乱神。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫如果能利用这种情绪的话，⟪k:5⟫应该对我们"
"有利。"

