#: scenario8:scenario8_7AD4545B_43E2_48BB_83DC_EA12AA8AC13D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cdea99a0af0471d443d71bd6a304b03d179c702df54a0e7efd55781d64aff5b3
