msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫洋馆里存在的一切……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫我都没有尝试去思考或理解。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D9031696_32C5_4F5B_AAC5_B715F70B4857
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f125805c7be52016b9493d14573a000d95a2d6b0674f86bc25b47499c586d45
