msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫So I guess... ⟪k:3⟫our first task is to earn Mell’s trust."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫那么……⟪k:3⟫首先我们要得得到梅尔的信任……对吧。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_7BB33D02_E8B5_4D6D_BA08_72D51A5A7020
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ec93efa194d143877436606bb9602a531699a633cd2d7af705ab7809ad333a7
