msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7BB33D02_E8B5_4D6D_BA08_72D51A5A7020"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Morgana’s death is in three days...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫We have until then to get all three "
"keys..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……三天后，⟪k:3⟫莫尔加娜就要迎接死亡了……⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫要在那之前，⟪k:6⟫从那三人手里拿到"
"全部的钥匙……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_6549EA6F_B9B1_4040_9379_5CDAA3BE5A72
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dbee0cda4eb419e1f90e29814ea69fe290a8851ccfaf9978a912e7f0b9f07bad
