msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6549EA6F_B9B1_4040_9379_5CDAA3BE5A72"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It won’t be easy.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I mean, we weren’t even present in this world until "
"today..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫真是……⟪k:3⟫很困难啊。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫在他们看来，我们不过是突然出现的可疑人物罢了……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4293848C_4AD9_4E87_A2C6_4663BFA0DF86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f2426c66ee26fe3d752009c74e1a507477cf58764ee6784dcdd2014a5f17dd4c
