msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You’re right. We should find and talk to his sister."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……确实是这样，⟪k:3⟫那首先，⟪k:4⟫得去找到奈莉。⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫比起告诉梅尔真相，⟪k:7⟫逼迫"
