msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫No, you’re exactly right.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫But what I was going to say..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫嗯，⟪k:3⟫你说得没错。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫不过，⟪k:6⟫我刚刚想说的是……"

