msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫因为……我考虑不周，⟪k:3⟫而且太不会观言察色了。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_5A78784D_5C36_42E6_8253_744344593347
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c02fca76b8a02bf64936417dcc8fedc49122a205fa0e96641cad9ee79dfbcb6
